# Inputs for requirements-integration.lock: the environment the CI
# `integration` job installs (Ubuntu, Python 3.12).
#
# Pinned framework versions: the last set the integration job passed with
# (CI run on 2026-08-20). Their transitive dependencies are resolved
# together with IronMesh's own dev + rns extras, constrained to the versions
# in requirements.lock, by scripts/refresh-integration-lock.sh.
#
# Why pinned: the job used to `pip install` these one at a time, unpinned.
# Each install resolved on its own, so the final environment could be
# incoherent. From September 2026 onward, autogen-core 0.7.5 (protobuf ~=5.29)
# and newer googleapis-common-protos releases pulled in by CrewAI
# (protobuf >=6.33.5) collided, and the import of a generated protobuf
# module failed before any test ran.
#
# To move to newer frameworks, change the pins below, run
# scripts/refresh-integration-lock.sh, and land the result in a PR whose
# integration job passes (pip check clean, imports, tests/integration green).
langchain-core==1.6.0
crewai==1.15.17
autogen-agentchat==0.7.5
